stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pending: Employee request
  Pending --> Cancelled: Driver or manager cancel
  Pending --> Rejected: Manager reject
  Pending --> Approved: Manager approve
  Approved --> Approved: Key collected
  Approved --> Flagged: Missed check-out window
  Approved --> CheckedOut: 5 photos + mileage
  Flagged --> CheckedOut: Late check-out still allowed
  CheckedOut --> Flagged: Overdue return
  CheckedOut --> CheckedIn: 5 photos + mileage
  Flagged --> CheckedIn: Late check-in still allowed
  CheckedIn --> Closed: Approver confirms key return
